      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبَاوَةٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبِىَ</span> [q. v.]. (S, Msb, K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ ذُو غَبَاوَةٍ</span> means <i>He is one to whom things,</i>
or <i>affairs, are unapparent,</i> or <i>obscure;</i> or <i>from
whom they are hidden,</i> or <i>concealed.</i> (TA.)

